# CODEOWNERS — Brain vault
#
# NOTE: Replace `@OWNER` below with the operator's real GitHub handle
#       (e.g. `@nithu00` — actual handle TBD).
# NOTE: Replace `@TEAMMATE` placeholder with the teammate's real GitHub
#       handle once access is granted.
#
# Branch protection (require CODEOWNERS review) MUST be enabled
# separately in the GitHub repo UI:
#   Settings -> Branches -> Branch protection rules -> main
#     [x] Require a pull request before merging
#     [x] Require review from Code Owners
#     [x] Require status checks (brain_audit, path_guard) to pass
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner1> [owner2 ...]
# Last match wins. More specific patterns go LOWER in this file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: everything is owner-reviewed unless overridden below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                              @OWNER

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operator no-touch zones (teammate must never edit without OPERATOR-APPROVED)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/_decisions/                   @OWNER
/_maps/                        @OWNER
/_runbooks/                    @OWNER
/_promote-candidates/          @OWNER
/claude-context/               @OWNER
/.github/                      @OWNER
/scripts/                      @OWNER
/90-archive/                   @OWNER

# Root rule / system files
/README.md                     @OWNER
/00-DASHBOARD.md               @OWNER
/01-CURRENT-FOCUS.md           @OWNER
/BRAIN-RULES.md                @OWNER
/SYSTEM-AUDIT.md               @OWNER

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nexus area — teammate can EDIT, but PRs still require owner review.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/01-nexus/                     @OWNER

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude inbox — teammate may write into nexus/ subfolder, but PRs still
# go through owner review (the inbox itself is shared scratch space).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/00-claude-inbox/nexus/        @OWNER
